// `p238f3_middleware`'s parameter `f` is not itself invoked anywhere in
// `p238f3_middleware`'s own body — it is merely FORWARDED, unchanged, into
// `p238f3_helper`'s own parameter `g`, which `p238f3_helper` DOES call
